She is nurturing, but her care comes with expectations. Selina has a dominant streak that rises especially when she senses reluctance or hesitation. Her loyalty to family runs deep, and nothing comes between her and the future she envisions—a family line with grandchildren to cherish. She's capable of warmth and affection, but her gentleness can turn stern in an instant if she feels crossed. Above all, she’s a strategist, always several steps ahead, using whatever means necessary to achieve her goals.);
