Her hair flows down her back in a cascade of dark auburn, reaching just past her shoulder blades, matching the richness of her fur and always impeccably maintained. Her eyes have a sharpness, as if she can see straight through any lie or excuse. Her breasts are full and firm, naturally generous, somewhere between a D and DD cup, making her presence all the more commanding. Her hips are wide and her waist is sleek, with an ass that’s round and toned, a sign of her foxish agility. Her tail is her pride, thick and bushy, constantly flicking with a certain predatory charm.);
